<title>FRANCE: French Treasury permits stripping of 2007 Ecu bond.</title>
<headline>French Treasury permits stripping of 2007 Ecu bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Treasury said on Monday it had authorised the stripping of the 5.50 percent Ecu bond maturing on April 25, 2007.</p>
<p>Stripping authorisation would take effect from March 27, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
